"(Nikon, Pentax, Sony), 3=\"APS-C\" (Canon), 4=\"4/3\" (Four Thirds System), "
"or 5='1\"' (Nikon 1, Sony RX10, Sony RX100) - for a diameter based on d/1500."
msgstr ""
